poilog-fortran is a Fortran translation of the computational code in the R
package poilog 0.4.2.1.

Original authors:
  Vidar Grotan
  Steinar Engen

Upstream package license: GPL-3
Upstream package title: Poisson Lognormal and Bivariate Poisson Lognormal Distribution

This derivative translation preserves the GPL-3 license. Plotting code and
R-specific presentation infrastructure were intentionally not translated.
